//
// The first half of HeMAiA's llm_layer_4cluster, at the layer's own shape: T = 32 tokens,
// d_model = 128, one head (d_head == d_model). The datagen draws x and the three weights
// from the same seed and in the same order as util/sim/llm/llm_layer_data.py, so every
// tensor here is the tensor that layer computes.
//
// TOKENS must be 32: it is FlashAttention's query tile Br (one FP16 lane per query) and,
// for this decode-shaped layer, also its key tile Bc -- the projected K of these tokens
// IS the KV tile the check matmul reads. D_MODEL must be a power of two (the RMSNorm's
// 1/D is an exponent subtract) and a multiple of 32.
{
    TOKENS: 32,
    D_MODEL: 128,
}
